Task: TV6-D22 Tạo test phân vùng 3–2 (PartitionHarness — Live 5-Node Loopback TCP Network Partition & Heal Harness, Processes Kept Alive)
Date: 2026-11-23
Base Commit: c80341d (branch Huu)
Environment: Linux 7.3.3-300.fc45.x86_64 (amd64), OpenJDK 25.0.4.1, Apache Maven 3.9.11
TASK_SCOPE=5-node live loopback TCP partition/heal harness with TV3-D21 filter hooks (MessageDispatcher.MessageFilterHook & RaftRpcClient.RpcFilterHook), keeping all 5 NodeMain processes alive (partition != crash) and collecting responses from BOTH majority (3/5) and minority (2/5) sides before and after heal; full Raft consensus + PostgreSQL AC09 safety belongs to Gate G6.

Deliverables & SHA256:
- integration-tests/src/test/java/vn/nhom6/railway/tests/PartitionHarness.java
  SHA256=5cd90f953726701494cb6fb8c5e8ebe7f82968993ce55ab47ceed87ac1930eea
- artifacts/evidence/D22/TV6-D22-result.log (this evidence file)
- docs/implementation/TV6-D22-notes.md

Dependencies & Scope Boundaries:
- Uses TV3-D21 production filter hooks (MessageDispatcher.setFilterHook, RaftRpcClient.setFilterHook) and live NodeMain dual-port TCP servers (Client port + Raft Peer port), TcpClient, NodeStatusHandler (TV3-D15), RequestVoteRpcHandler, AppendEntriesRpcHandler, FakeBookingService, FakeRaftRequestHandler.
- Verifies TV6-D21 fault scripts presence and volume-preservation contract (scripts/stop-node.ps1, scripts/restart-node.ps1, scripts/select-leader.ps1).
- Built independently without waiting for TV5-D22.

Verified Scenarios in PartitionHarness (8/8 PASS):
1. baselineFullMesh_allFiveNodesAlive_peerRpcsAndClientResponsesSucceed: PASS (5/5 nodes alive, 20/20 directed TCP links, 5/5 NODE_STATUS)
2. partition3vs2_blocksTwelveCrossLinks_whileIntraPartitionTrafficAndAllFiveProcessesStayAlive: PASS (12 blocked links, 5/5 processes alive & answering PING/NODE_STATUS, intra-A & intra-B TCP RPCs pass, cross-partition RPCs dropped & timed out)
3. partition3vs2_collectsResponsesFromBothSidesSimultaneously_thenHealsAndRestoresFullMesh: PASS (collected NODE_STATUS + client responses from majority 3/5 [CONFIRMED + NOT_LEADER redirect] AND minority 2/5 [UNKNOWN + NOT_LEADER redirect] simultaneously; healed without restarting any process; restored cross-partition APPEND_ENTRIES & REQUEST_VOTE and 5/5 post-heal NODE_STATUS)
4. partition3vs2_selectiveOutboundAndInboundFilterHooks_dropCrossPartitionWithoutKillingSockets: PASS (outbound RaftRpcClient + inbound MessageDispatcher hooks + drop/deliver telemetry)
5. asymmetricPartition_unidirectionalLinkBlock_preservesReverseDirectionAndProcessLiveness: PASS
6. selectiveMessageTypeDrop_blocksRequestVoteAcrossBoundary_whileAppendEntriesAndStatusContinue: PASS
7. successivePartitions_rotate3vs2Boundaries_andHealCleanlyEveryCycle: PASS (2 rotating 3–2 partition/heal cycles restoring 20/20 directed TCP links)
8. faultScriptsInventory_tv6D21ScriptsPresentAndExecutableContractVerified: PASS (3/3 TV6-D21 scripts present, zero destructive volume commands)

